y; and other forms or reports as required. The SEC maintains a website (www.sec.gov) that contains reports, proxy and information statements, and other information regarding issuers that file electronically with the SEC. We make available, free of charge, on ou","zh":"AT&T Inc.（「AT&T」、「我們」或「本公司」）是一家於 1983 年根據特拉華州法律註冊成立的控股公司，主要執行辦公室位於 208 S. Akard St., Dallas, Texas, 75202（電話號碼 210-821-4105）。我們維護一個網路網站：www.att.com。 （此網站地址僅供參考，無意成為活動連結或將任何網站資訊合併到本文檔中。）我們以電子方式向證券交易委員會 (SEC) 提交表格 8-K、表格 10-Q 和表格 10-K 所需的報告；代理資料；必要時，在表格 S-3 和 S-8 上填寫註冊聲明；以及其他需要的表格或報告。 SEC 維護一個網站 (www.sec.gov)，其中包含以電子方式向 SEC 提交的報告、委託書和資訊聲明以及有關發行人的其他資訊。我们在您的网站上免费提供"},{"en":"AT&T, formerly known as SBC Communications Inc. (SBC), was formed as one of several regional holding companies created to hold AT&T Corp.'s (ATTC) local telephone companies. On January 1, 1984, we were spun-off from ATTC pursuant to an anti-trust consent decree, becoming an independent publicly traded telecommunications services provider.","zh":"AT&T 的前身為 SBC Communications Inc. (SBC)，是為控股 AT&T Corp. (ATTC) 本地電話公司而創建的幾家區域控股公司之一。 1984 年 1 月 1 日，根據反壟斷同意令，我們從 ATTC 分拆出來，成為獨立的公開交易電信服務供應商。"},{"en":"In 2005, we merged one of our subsidiaries with ATTC, creating one of the world's leading telecommunications providers. In connection with the merger, we changed the name of our company from \"SBC Communications Inc.\" to \"AT&T Inc.\"","zh":"2005 年，我們將我們的子公司與 ATTC 合併，創建了世界領先的電信供應商之一。由於合併，我們將公司名稱從“SBC Communications Inc.”更改為“SBC Communications Inc.”。至“AT&T 公司”"}],"markets":[],"customers":[{"en":"Our Latin America segment provides wireless service in Mexico. We utilize our regional and national wireless networks in Mexico to provide consumer and business customers with wireless data and voice communication services. The Latin America segment provided approximately 3% of 2025 segment operating revenues and less than 1% of our 2025 total segment operating income. We divide our revenue into the following categories: service and equipment.","zh":"我們的拉丁美洲部門在墨西哥提供無線服務。我們利用墨西哥的區域和國家無線網路為消費者和企業客戶提供無線數據和語音通訊服務。拉丁美洲部門約佔 2025 年部門營業收入的 3%，占我們 2025 年部門總營業收入的不到 1%。我們將收入分為以下幾類：服務和設備。"}],"competition":[{"en":"Competition continues to increase for communications and digital services from traditional and nontraditional competitors. Technological advances have expanded the types and uses of services and products available. In addition, lack of or a reduced level of regulation of comparable legacy services has lowered costs for alternative communications service providers. As a result, we face continuing competition as well as some new opportunities in significant portions of our business.","zh":"來自傳統和非傳統競爭對手的通訊和數位服務競爭持續加劇。技術進步擴大了可用服務和產品的類型和用途。此外，對可比傳統服務缺乏監管或監管水準降低也降低了替代通訊服務提供者的成本。因此，我們在業務的重要部分面臨持續的競爭和一些新的機會。"},{"en":"Wireless We face substantial competition in our wireless businesses. Under current FCC rules, multiple licensees, who provide wireless services on the cellular, PCS, Advanced Wireless Services, 700 MHz and other spectrum bands, may operate in each of our U.S. service areas. Our competitors include two national wireless providers; a larger number of regional providers and resellers of each of those providers' services; and certain cable companies. In addition, we face competition from providers who offer voice, text messaging and other services as applications on data networks. We are one of three facilities-based providers in Mexico (retail and wholesale), with the most significant market share controlled by Am rica M vil. We may experience significant competition from companies that provide similar services using other communications technologies and services. While some of these techno","zh":"無線 我們的無線業務面臨激烈的競爭。根據目前的 FCC 規則，在蜂巢、PCS、高級無線服務、700 MHz 和其他頻段提供無線服務的多個被授權者可以在我們的每個美國服務區域運作。我們的競爭對手包括兩家國家無線提供者；大量的區域提供者和每個提供者的服務的經銷商；以及某些有線電視公司。此外，我們還面臨來自提供語音、簡訊和其他服務作為數據網路應用程式的供應商的競爭。我們是墨西哥三大設施供應商之一（零售和批發），最重要的市場份額由 Am rica M vil 控制。我們可能會遇到使用其他通訊技術和服務提供類似服務的公司的激烈競爭。雖然其中一些技術"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Communications","val":120896000000,"zh":"通訊"},{"name":"Latin America Business","val":4379000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲業務部門"}],"total":125648000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Service","val":101158000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Wireless Service","val":70099000000,"zh":"無線服務"},{"name":"Other Capitalized Property Plant & Equipment","val":24490000000,"zh":"其他資本化財產廠房設備"},{"name":"Business Service","val":15978000000,"zh":"商業服務"},{"name":"Legacy Voice & Data","val":10362000000,"zh":"傳統語音與數據"},{"name":"IP Broadband","val":3542000000,"zh":"IP寬頻"},{"name":"Other Service","val":1177000000,"zh":"其他服務"}],"total":125648000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"US","val":120219000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"MX","val":4428000000,"zh":"墨西哥"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":395000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Europe","val":382000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"All Other Geographical Areas","val":114000000,"zh":"所有其他地理區域"},{"name":"Region Of Latin America & Caribbean","val":110000000,"zh":"拉丁美洲和加勒比海地區"}],"total":125648000000}},"peers":["VZ","GE","MCD","KO","F"]}}